      en: ["Integrated into the North Sea Port cluster following the 2018 merger.", "The Ghent-Terneuzen Canal was originally opened for navigation in 1827.", "Home to one of the largest Dow Chemical production facilities globally.", "The New Lock (Nieuwe Sluis) ranks among the largest lock complexes in Europe.", "Primary transshipment point for biofuels and petrochemical raw materials.", "Features specialized terminals for the storage of liquid bulk chemicals."],
